`docs/migration-runbook.md` has had the two stores and the two admin endpoints in it since December. This adds the three sections that were still in my notes:

- what `docs/prior-cutover/` holds, and that it is the only account of a completed migration anyone kept;
- the smoke faults on a box, and the file that switches them on and off;
- the reset, and why the service wants stopping first.

It describes where things are. It does not write up the ap-2 run, because I cannot: nobody did.
